      "cooked": "<p>The most fanservicey episode per C&amp;A</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a73f9e7fcc82c52a93b4f18e2e582997c36cc10b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/a73f9e7fcc82c52a93b4f18e2e582997c36cc10b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a73f9e7fcc82c52a93b4f18e2e582997c36cc10b_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nRy2xmOeicSmtB6EEe4NeiP0NT5\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a73f9e7fcc82c52a93b4f18e2e582997c36cc10b_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a73f9e7fcc82c52a93b4f18e2e582997c36cc10b_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a73f9e7fcc82c52a93b4f18e2e582997c36cc10b_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a73f9e7fcc82c52a93b4f18e2e582997c36cc10b_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2979 622 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-255-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-531\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-255-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-531\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-255-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-531\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #255 - Writers' Room: Cosmic Tales Vol. 2 #531</a></h3>\n\n  <p>What's happening out in space? Nothing much, right?  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:48:31 Adam is sick! Christopher is injured! But, against all odds, they perseverse and end up telling a tale they're both very proud of. Does it hold up? Do you folks like...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
